<section style="background: rgb(223, 221, 208); padding: 72px 24px;"><div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Customer Care</p><h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 34px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 400;">Payment Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px; max-width: 620px;">How payment, pricing and subscriptions work when you shop with Amun Organics.</p></div></section>
<section style="padding: 72px 24px;"><div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 42px 72px; align-items: flex-start;"><nav aria-label="Policies" style="flex: 1 1 220px; max-width: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><a href="/pages/shipping-and-returns" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Shipping &amp; Returns</a><a href="/pages/klarna-payments" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Klarna Payments</a><a href="/pages/payment-terms-conditions" aria-current="page" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px; text-decoration: underline;">Payment Terms</a><a href="/pages/privacy-policy" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Privacy Policy</a></nav><div style="flex: 3 1 560px; min-width: 0px; max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 42px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Last updated November 2026</p><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Accepted Payment Methods</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">We accept major credit and debit cards and digital wallets offered at checkout, as well as Klarna, which lets you pay in 4 interest-free installments.</p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 10px;"><span style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 14px; text-transform: uppercase;">Visa</span><span style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 14px; text-transform: uppercase;">Mastercard</span><span style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 14px; text-transform: uppercase;">American Express</span><span style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 14px; text-transform: uppercase;">Apple Pay</span><span style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 14px; text-transform: uppercase;">Shop Pay</span><span style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 14px; text-transform: uppercase;">Klarna</span></div></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Pricing &amp; Currency</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Prices are shown in US dollars (USD) for the United States and Mexican pesos (MXN) for Mexico, based on the country you select. Applicable taxes and shipping are calculated and shown at checkout before you pay. We may update prices from time to time; the price you pay is the one shown when you place your order.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">When You Are Charged</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Your payment method is charged when you place your order. If a payment is declined, your order will not be processed until a valid payment is provided. For Klarna purchases, Klarna collects your installments on its own schedule.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Subscribe &amp; Save</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Subscriptions save 10% on every delivery and renew automatically on the schedule you choose, every month or every 3 months. Your saved payment method is charged before each order ships. You can skip a delivery or cancel anytime from your account.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Discounts &amp; Promotions</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">The 10% welcome offer applies to your first order only. Unless stated otherwise, discount codes cannot be combined with each other or with subscription savings, and they have no cash value.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Security</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">All payments are processed through secure, encrypted checkout. We never store your full card details. To protect you, some orders may be reviewed before they are fulfilled.</p></div><div style="margin-top: 60px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px;"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px;">Still have questions?</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">We usually reply within 1-2 business days.</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px;"><a href="/pages/contact-us" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; background: rgb(88, 81, 40); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;">Contact Us</a><a href="/pages/faqs" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;">Read the FAQ</a></div></div></div></div></section>
